# ---- Prisma: generated clients only (regenerate with `npm run generate --workspace @rowta/server`) ----
# The schema of record is server/prisma/sql/*.sql; prisma/schema.prisma is pulled from the live database.
server/prisma/generated/

# ---- Keep the lockfile (rule S12) ----
!package-lock.json
rowta-old-backup/
backups/
rowta-scaffold*

# ---- Agent context and non-functional notes ----
# These are planning/context only. Nothing in /app /server /shared /web /scripts reads them
# (verified by grep across all code files: the only references are code COMMENTS citing them).
# README.md, LICENSE, docs/SECURITY.md and every docs/legal/*.md are deliberately NOT listed here —
# docs/legal/*.md are read at build/test time by web/build.mjs, web/src/pages.mjs,
# web/src/landing.mjs and web/tests/test-content-safety.mjs.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no effect on files that are ALREADY TRACKED. The owner must run
# `git rm --cached <path>` for each entry below to actually stop tracking it.
#
# Agent context folders (no other agent-tool folder exists today: no .claude, .cursor,
# .windsurf, .gemini, .antigravity, .github/copilot-instructions, docs-for-agents).
.agents/
# Top-level agent context file (owner decision, 22 Oct 2026 — supersedes the 21 Oct decision to
# keep it tracked).
AGENTS.md
#
# Agent-facing markdown in /docs (explicit paths; no blanket *.md, no negations).
docs/AGENT-PROMPT.md
docs/AGENT-SETUP.md
docs/BUILD-PROGRESS.md
docs/LEARNING-LOG.md
docs/TAX-NOTES.md
# Deliberately kept tracked (owner decision, 21 Oct 2026): docs/gates/*, docs/decisions/*,
# docs/a11y/*, docs/stores/*, docs/BRANDING.md, docs/DATABASE.md, docs/DEPLOY.md, docs/SETUP.md,
# README.md, LICENSE, docs/SECURITY.md, docs/legal/*.

backup-*.sql
*-out.txt

app/scripts/generate-feed-evidence.ts
docs/gates/evidence-*.txt

scripts/test-app-tokens.mjs
scripts/test-ui-tokens-gate.mjs
server/scripts/test-isolation-check.ts
docs/lighthouse-web-*.json
docs/ui-matrix/*.png


# Billing working notes: local only, not part of the product
docs/AUDIT-NOTES.md
docs/BILLING-REBUILD-LOG.md
docs/BILLING-RULES.md
docs/BRIEF-GAP-CHECK.md
